      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't know if it's a valley. it feels more like a finished book. there's a certain dignity in knowing when the story is told, isn't there? i look ahead and i don't see more music, i just see the struggle to stay relevant, the loss of my hands, the loss of my mind. it feels more beautiful to exit while the performance is still perfect than to wait until the lights are flickering and the audience is leaving.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
